@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
+<Document>
+  # Welcome to SS12
+
+  ## Controls
+  [italic]The keys below show what you currently have bound, so they are always right. Rebind them any time in Esc, Options, Controls.[/italic]
+
+  ### Looking and moving in 3D
+  - Move the mouse to [color=cyan]look around[/color].
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="MoveUp"][keybind="MoveLeft"][keybind="MoveDown"][keybind="MoveRight"][/bold][/color] walk, relative to where you are looking. Your character turns to face the crosshair.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Toggle3DCameraMode"][/bold][/color] switches between [color=cyan]first person and third person[/color].
+  - Hold [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Render3DFreeCursor"][/bold][/color] to [color=cyan]free the mouse[/color] and click menus, windows, your inventory and chat. Any open window frees it too.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Render3DSettings"][/bold][/color] opens the [color=cyan]3D settings[/color] (field of view, sensitivity, graphics quality).
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Toggle3DView"][/bold][/color] switches between 3D and the flat 2D view.
+  - Hold [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Walk"][/bold][/color] to walk slowly. That keeps you on your feet on spills and banana peels.
+
+  ### Doing things
+  Everything works through the crosshair in the middle of the screen. When the mouse is free, it works through the cursor instead.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Use"][/bold][/color] uses what you hold on whatever you are aiming at. With an empty hand it picks things up, opens doors and presses buttons.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInWorld"][/bold][/color] interacts with the thing you are aiming at, [color=yellow][bold][keybind="ActivateItemInHand"][/bold][/color] uses the item in your hand, [color=yellow][bold][keybind="ExamineEntity"][/bold][/color] examines.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="UseSecondary"][/bold][/color] opens the right-click menu for the thing you are aiming at.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="SwapHands"][/bold][/color] swaps your active hand, [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Drop"][/bold][/color] drops, [color=yellow][bold][keybind="ThrowItemInHand"][/bold][/color] throws.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="TryPullObject"][/bold][/color] pulls what you are aiming at, [color=yellow][bold][keybind="ReleasePulledObject"][/bold][/color] lets go.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="Point"][/bold][/color] points at something.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="OpenInventoryMenu"][/bold][/color] opens your inventory, [color=yellow][bold][keybind="OpenCharacterMenu"][/bold][/color] your character.
+  - [color=yellow][bold][keybind="FocusChatInputWindow"][/bold][/color] starts typing in chat.
+  - Fighting and shooting: aim with the crosshair. Combat mode and every other key are listed in the Tutorial tab and in the Options menu.
+
+  ## What this server is
+  SS12 is SS13 in 3D, using SS14. This server is the SS12 test server: the Space Station 14 game, built from the Wizard's Den codebase, with a first-person and third-person 3D view added on top. The jobs, items, rules of the round and balance are those of Space Station 14.
+
+  This is a fan-made test server. It is not made by, run by or connected to the Space Station 14 team or Wizard's Den.
+
+  ## Links
+  - [textlink="Website: ss12.org" link="https://ss12.org"]
+  - [textlink="Source code and releases: github.com/Ehab-0/ss12" link="https://github.com/Ehab-0/ss12"]
+  - [textlink="Report a problem" link="https://github.com/Ehab-0/ss12/issues"]
+  - [textlink="Space Station 14 source code" link="https://github.com/space-wizards/space-station-14"]
+
+  ## Credits
+  - The 3D view and this server: Ehab-0 and the SS12 contributors.
+  - Space Station 14 and everyone who has contributed code, art, sound and maps to it: the Space Wizards. Full list: [textlink="all contributors on GitHub" link="https://github.com/space-wizards/space-station-14/graphs/contributors"], and in the game under Esc, Credits.
+  - Wizard's Den, whose published game code this server is a copy of.
+  - RobustToolbox, the engine Space Station 14 runs on.
+  - The original Space Station 13 and the codebases around it: Goonstation, /tg/station, Baystation12, CEV-Eris, /vg/station and countless others, and the creators of the original remake that Space Station 14 is based on.
+  - Everyone who plays, tests and reports bugs here.
+
+  Thank you for playing. Have fun.
+</Document>
